<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Hyundai Oil resumes CDU operation.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Hyundai Oil resumes CDU operation.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Hyundai Oil Refinery Co said on Monday that it had resumed operation of its No 2 200,000 barrel-per-day (bpd) crude distillation unit (CDU) on Friday after an annual maintenance shutdown.</p>
<p>The unit was closed down on May 10.</p>
<p>Hyundai Oil, an affiliate of Hyundai Group, has a total refining capacity of 310,000 bpd.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
